'''Momotaro''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 2.7 Update|Version 2.7]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS]] and [[RED BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|RED BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] increases their health, attack power, range, speed and chance to [[Freeze|freeze]] [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] and [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.9 Update|Version 8.9]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]].

